### C05复跑方式

打开保存的新图并进入Play，向临时GameObject添加NewMapPlayChecks；仅测试入口允许查找依赖，生产组件全部Inspector绑定。等Finished后读取Passed/Failed/Results，退出Play后销毁夹具，不保存Play状态。以下为本轮实际调用（只有测试使用）：

```csharp
var player=UnityEngine.Object.FindFirstObjectByType<Regrowth.Runtime.PlayerState>();
var run=UnityEngine.Object.FindFirstObjectByType<Regrowth.Runtime.RunController>();
var flow=UnityEngine.Object.FindFirstObjectByType<Regrowth.Runtime.ChoiceCoordinator>();
var panel=UnityEngine.Object.FindFirstObjectByType<Regrowth.UI.ChoicePanel>();
var gates=UnityEngine.Object.FindObjectsByType<Regrowth.Gameplay.Challenge.InspectionDoor2D>(UnityEngine.FindObjectsSortMode.None);System.Array.Sort(gates,(a,b)=>string.CompareOrdinal(a.name,b.name));
var boxes=UnityEngine.Object.FindObjectsByType<Regrowth.Gameplay.Chest>(UnityEngine.FindObjectsSortMode.None);System.Array.Sort(boxes,(a,b)=>string.CompareOrdinal(a.name,b.name));
var go=new UnityEngine.GameObject("C05 TEMPORARY PLAY CHECKS - NEVER SAVE");
var test=go.AddComponent<Regrowth.Tests.C05.NewMapPlayChecks>();test.Begin(player,run,flow,panel,gates,boxes);
```

